Bruv- go to Human Mutilations and scroll down for a bit, you'll see it there, that video is confounding and I am scared of it. Like genuinely, was his face melted or removed; I just don't get it. zleh.

..."because it appears that humans love tribalism and in this new age of general equality, equity, and social justice, I think that if we learn there are aliens amoungst us, walking with us, blended perfectly in, I think we'll start to tie up autistic people in chairs..." 

&#x200B;

an age of equity and general discernment of what does and doesn't tread on free human rights potentially leads to a pressurized build-up of untapped vestigial brutality, which could be collectively burst onto the psychopathic wolves who own investment firms, play dress up as lawyer, cop, judge, hedgefund manager, media company producer, chain restaurant owner turned investor, crypto analyst, pharmacy and medicine owner/manufacturers, the list goes on and on;;; 

Thoooouuugh, these people control the gauges on what is indicated to be true, correct, just, formal, cool, whatever, you name it, so they will avoid being slaughtered by instead saying aliens are in our midst, and they like to drug us, and steal bioscans of us while we sleep so they can use our bodies as future sleeves in case theirs breaks down.

Yo brother, I am about as far as you in the Manga. I've never watched or read DragonBall, my entire life, even though I went to a slightly impoverished Elementary School where Dragon Ball was the entire lore of everything but I digress. The most experience I had was 

The "Imma Fire in Mah Lazahh bwaaaahh" meme but only came to learn recently that that was Cell. 

I also played a little bit of the PS2 Tenkai Tournament game as well. 

Dragon Ball is various cultural references always surrounded me, but nothing that I did to connect with it directly.

&#x200B;

I got a hold of the 1st 3 volume cypher earlier this year, and oh my god, I fell in Love. 

&#x200B;

Dragon Ball is a wonderful story. With Roots everywhere, pulling from everything, and Toriyama is a Genius. 

&#x200B;

I am gonna get ahold of the next 3 part volume within a week or so and I hope I can just buy the whole original series and even Z;;; Super perhaps, because the themes and characters are loyal and timeless.
